#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "Choose PlayStation or Switch button positions. The selected mapping stays fixed during menus and gameplay; customizing a button creates a custom profile."
msgstr "Choose PlayStation or Switch button positions. The selected mapping stays fixed during menus and gameplay; customizing a button creates a custom profile."

#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "The deadzone ignores small stick movements near the center. At 8%, movements below 8% do not steer the game. Increase it if your character moves by itself; lower it if aiming feels unresponsive."
msgstr "The deadzone ignores small stick movements near the center. At 8%, movements below 8% do not steer the game. Increase it if your character moves by itself; lower it if aiming feels unresponsive."

